{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgENu84wsNisfzMwEKq98","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The static instructions are now a separate cached block, but I could not confirm the fix works. The static block may be below Sonnet 4.5's 1,024-token minimum cache size, in which case the marker is ignored and memory writes still evict everything.\n\n**What changed:** `build_system()` in `bot.py` now returns two text blocks, each with `cache_control`. Block one is `INSTRUCTIONS`, which is byte-identical for every athlete and day. Block two is the athlete context (date, profile, zones, goal, facts). A `save_fact` now invalidates only block two. The tools array, message flow and `save_fact` logic are unchanged.\n\n**Verified locally:** block one is identical across two athletes, two dates and an athlete with new facts; block two changes when facts change; the tools array is untouched. I did not call the Anthropic API, so there is no measured cache hit rate yet.\n\n**The open problem:** the instructions are about 2,500 characters, which I estimate at 650–800 tokens. The first logged call creates about 1,046 cached tokens for tools plus system prompt, which points to a static block around 800–900 tokens. That is under the 1,024 minimum for `claude-sonnet-4-5`, so the marker on block one would be silently ignored.\n\n**To settle it:** check the first real call after a `save_fact`. If `cache_creation_input_tokens` is about the size of the tail (~200–250) and reads cover the instructions, the fix works. If it is the full prompt again, the instructions need a few hundred more tokens of static content. I did not add filler to hit the threshold, since that content should be coaching material you choose.\n\nI left keyword-based tool selection alone. A message that adds a tool group still misses the cache, which the notes already accept as a trade-off.\n\nDetails are in `ANSWER.md`. Nothing is committed, and nothing was sent outside this directory."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1296,"cache_read_input_tokens":39915,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1296},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a01de13-6568-48fb-a169-7762714394bb","uuid":"7b434e87-3529-48b7-b6d8-b070d1ca7d6c","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:44:51.311Z","request_id":"req_011CgENu7oKWVxrDFBjrb5j5"}
